contentText:
Billy Joel is saying goodbye to his motorcycle collection as he continues to navigate his normal pressure hydrocephalus diagnosis.

In an interview with The Hollywood Reporter published Thursday (Oct. 15), the New York native opened up about selling his bikes while giving a rare health update. He&#8217;s still unsure of whether he&#8217;s able to perform onstage, revealing, &#8220;I have to take a series of tests before I know.&#8221;

